                report next week if you have any doubts or queries.</p>

                <p>Thanks</p>
            ''' % (client_name,domain,url)
        elif report_type == 'PPC':
            email_content = ''' 
                <p>Hello %s,</p>
                <p>Hope you are doing well.</p>
                <p>Please find below your Campaign Performance report for the last (30 days), to give you an understanding of %s current performance.</p>

                <p>The PPC report will help you to understand the following performance:</p>
